01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The Great Northfield, Minnesota Raid is a 1972 American
Western film about the James-Younger Gang.

11
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
Distributed by Universal Pictures, it was written and directed by Philip
Kaufman in a cinéma vérité style and stars Cliff Robertson.

12
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The film purports to recreate the James-Younger Gang's most infamous escapade, the September 7,
1876 robbery of "the biggest bank west of the Mississippi", in Northfield, Minnesota.

13
01:24:30,000 --> 01:24:36,000
The tone is emotional.
